{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-code-security#feature-1","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-code-security","commit":"30ca735a293bbf95abba63add72dd24dcb94b425","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-security 的功能「工作区扫描」：检查整个工作区或指定文件、目录，并返回发现、计数和扫描覆盖情况。通过 secure_scan 工具触发，可选择启用的扫描引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:156-160"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-code-security#feature-2","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-code-security","commit":"30ca735a293bbf95abba63add72dd24dcb94b425","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-security 的功能「Git 改动检查」：审查 Git diff 中新增的行，可选择基线、暂存状态和目标文件，也可纳入未跟踪文件。通过 secure_diff 工具触发，结果记录检查发现和覆盖情况。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:190-197"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-code-security#feature-3","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-code-security","commit":"30ca735a293bbf95abba63add72dd24dcb94b425","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-security 的功能「修复复核」：沿用上次检查的范围与引擎再次检查，并汇总已关闭、仍存在和新增的问题。通过 secure_fix_verify 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:228-232"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-code-security#feature-4","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-code-security","commit":"30ca735a293bbf95abba63add72dd24dcb94b425","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-security 的功能「报告导出」：将最近一次检查结果整理为 SARIF 2.1.0 或 Markdown，可返回文本，也可按指定路径写入文件。通过 secure_export 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:394-398"]}
